wTTPdJ-5t7MX4kXItJvTwbEQthjjwB21b8Kydw&oe=6AF20186"}, {"file_name": "Nomsters_Screenshot_Selfie.png", "id": "868726939398778", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_868726942732111_9122971319496673450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CL21VPqJ0FcQ7kNvwEjcTfl&_nc_oc=Adrx_EaIpKujeigYoOk1cz-WcWFplS8Mw_L_7aJInDBSZ0j7CYayO202Bzj4VT9sk-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_f5XKKhp6nq2UQvhYURp28a14D6HVAPrQYS3Rad73gQ&oe=6AF203C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nomsters", "keywords": ["pet", "collection", "idle", "multiplayer", "social"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \n{1497741095437880}\n# Collect. Mutate. Trade. Rebirth!\n\nStep into the charming, cozy world of Nomsters, the ultimate relaxing creature-collector in VR! Gather adorable companions, build your dream team, and take them along as you explore and grow together. Whether you\u2019re a casual collector or a completionist, there\u2019s always a new Nomster waiting to be found!\n\n# Key Features\n\ud83d\udc3e **Collect & Mutate**: Discover dozens of unique Nomsters across various rarities. Experiment with mutations to unlock rare, powerful forms, and build the ultimate companion group to take out into the world.\n\n\ud83e\udd1d **Trade with Friends**: Got duplicates or hunting for that missing Nomster? Trade with other players to complete your collection!\n\n\u26cf\ufe0f **Fun Game Modes**: Put your Nomsters to work! Send your companions into Mining to gather valuable resources, or jump into Defense mode to ward off incoming threats and earn exclusive rewards.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Rebirth & Grow**: Power up through the Rebirth system. Reset your progress to unlock new abilities, boost your stats, and upgrade your home base!\n\n**Ready to meet your new best friends?** \n# Wishlist Nomsters today and start building your collection!", "short_description": "Collect. Mutate. Trade. Rebirth!\n\nStep into the charming, cozy world of Nomsters, the ultimate relaxing creature-collector in VR! Gather adorable companions, build your dream team, and take them along as you explore and grow together. Whether you\u2019re a casual collector or a completionist, there\u2019s always a new Nomster waiting to be found!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.squidostudio.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Squido Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.squidostudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1551144209995635"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "979192685222397"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "979192685222397"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790269260, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "979192685222397"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {